            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EMap Umbraco Content Types to any of 780\u002B Schema.org types and automatically generate JSON-LD structured data. Features confidence-scored auto-mapping, a backoffice UI for manual fine-tuning, seven property source types (property, static, parent, ancestor, sibling, block content, complex), HTML/URL/date transforms, culture-aware variant support, Delivery API integration, and a Razor tag helper for server-rendered templates. Can also scaffold new Umbraco document types from Schema.org models.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/umbraco.community.schemeweaver\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
